---

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker">By the numbers</div>
      <h2>Built for the throughput your ops team actually needs.</h2>
      <p>Verdict returns a single calibrated choice from a set you define at request time — never free-form text.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metrics">
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="val a">90ms</span>
        <div class="lbl">p50 latency. p99 holds at <b>140ms</b> under sustained load.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="val m">$0.04</span>
        <div class="lbl">Per 1,000 decisions. Volume tiers down to $0.018.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="val a">100%</span>
        <div class="lbl">Schema-valid outputs. Zero parse failures, zero retries.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="val m">0</span>
        <div class="lbl">Retraining cycles required to add a new option or rule.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .metrics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .metric {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px 22px;
    transition: 0.18s;
  }
  .metric:hover {
    border-color: #c9d0e4;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .metric .val {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    display: block;
  }
  .metric .val.a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .metric .val.m {
    color: var(--mint);
  }
  .metric .lbl {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .metrics {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .metrics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
